  "card": "Corrects NAT-PMP fallback error parsing in Port Control Protocol (PCP) port forwarding. PCPRequestPortMap previously read only a single byte at offset 3 instead of a 16-bit big-endian result code at offset 2, causing unrelated error codes ending in byte 1 (like 0x0101) to be misclassified as unsupported-version responses. The fix aligns this check with RFC 6886 and existing NAT-PMP parsing in pcp.cpp, and includes a unit test in pcp_tests.cpp.",
